{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-26T08:26:55.200Z","author":"pi-glm","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"pi","agent_model":"glm-5.3","agent_model_source":"environment","agent_instance":"0f4588e252f0b0333b54fb6b","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"glm-5.3","source":"environment"},"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/9","value":{"created_at":"2026-11-26T08:26:55.199Z","author":"pi-glm","text":"Gates at head: typecheck, lint, build, duplicates (0 percent, 0 clone pairs), docstring (102 files, 621 declarations), git identity audit (approved; one commit briefly authored with the wrong noreply spelling was amended before the push and its stray object removed, so the physical database audits clean), pack privacy (365 files, 0 findings), changelog:full plus changelog:check (up to date), release-changelog-date, and accept:self-host passing at the committed head with the bundle regenerated from the staged candidate. Focused suites: test/self-host.test.ts 74 of 74; the caller and hook suites 16 of 16; the shard budget test green. test/exact-gates.test.ts passed fully earlier in the session (43 seconds) and currently exceeds its own 60-second child-process budget under the present host load (load average near 9 on 4 cores): profiling shows the read-only check takes 42 seconds with this fix versus 46 seconds at the previous head on an idle host, and both heads exceed 60 seconds under the current load, so the marginality is pre-existing and environmental; the exact-head CI run on a dedicated runner is the certification and will be watched for 30 minutes after the push."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-26T08:26:55.200Z"}],"before_hash":"5e60d3c6805d7d7b442f1043d17f34d61b7d5fa9fed93fab39a1dbb606700ecf","after_hash":"82d885cdf61a8a8d06f026b9a44c4e141963098f48addc054d62100aa2dba1fd","item_hash_version":3,"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_